source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Create a new destination (source → destination pipeline)

Usage: vendo destinations create [OPTIONS] --dest-app <appId> --data-type <type> --config-file <path>

Options:
      --dest-app <appId>      Destination app ID (must have destination role)
      --profile <name>        Use a specific account profile
      --debug                 Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --source-app <appId>    Source app ID (optional for some data types)
      --data-type <type>      Data type (e.g. events, user_properties, conversions)
      --config-file <path>    Path to JSON with { global?, tasks: [...] }
      --schedule-file <path>  Path to JSON with schedule overrides
      --frequency <value>     Sync frequency value [default: 1]
      --unit <unit>           Sync frequency unit (hours, days, weeks, months) [default: days]
      --run-now               Trigger first sync immediately
      --json                  Output raw JSON
      --output <field>        Print a single field (e.g. id)
  -h, --help                  Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo destinations create --dest-app <onesignal-app-id> --data-type events --config-file tasks.json
  $ vendo destinations create --source-app <bq-id> --dest-app <os-id> --data-type user_properties --config-file tasks.json --run-now
